{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "SEKO PoolDose",
  "description": {
    "en": "SEKO PoolDose pool controllers on the local network: pH, ORP, chlorine, temperature, alarms.",
    "fr": "Régulateurs de piscine SEKO PoolDose en local : pH, redox, chlore, température, alarmes."
  },
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/lm1lc3n7/gladys-seko-pooldose:0.1.1",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LM1LC3N7/gladys-seko-pooldose/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["environment", "appliances"],
  "transports": ["local"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Your PoolDose",
        "fr": "Votre PoolDose"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Brings a SEKO PoolDose pool controller (and the VÁGNER POOL, BWT and KEMI DOSE models built on it) into Gladys, read through its own HTTP API on the local network, without the cloud: water temperature, pH, ORP, free chlorine, the pH, ORP and chlorine setpoints, the mode of the dosing pumps, the pause of the dosing and the alarms, each alarm also as a scene trigger. Enter the IP address of the device, save, then add it from the Discovery tab. Read only: Gladys never doses nor changes a setpoint. Ported from python-pooldose; never tested with a real device. Not affiliated with SEKO.",
        "fr": "Amène dans Gladys un régulateur de piscine SEKO PoolDose (et les modèles VÁGNER POOL, BWT et KEMI DOSE qui en dérivent), lu par sa propre API HTTP sur le réseau local, sans le cloud : température de l’eau, pH, redox, chlore libre, consignes de pH, de redox et de chlore, mode des pompes doseuses, pause du dosage et alarmes, chaque alarme aussi en déclencheur de scène. Saisissez l’adresse IP de l’appareil, enregistrez, puis ajoutez-le depuis l’onglet Découverte. Lecture seule : Gladys ne dose jamais et ne change aucune consigne. Porté de python-pooldose ; jamais testé avec un vrai appareil. Sans lien avec SEKO."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/LM1LC3N7/gladys-seko-pooldose/blob/main/docs/fr.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Guide (French)",
            "fr": "Guide (français)"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/LM1LC3N7/gladys-seko-pooldose/blob/main/docs/en.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Guide (English)",
            "fr": "Guide (anglais)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "host",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Address of the PoolDose",
        "fr": "Adresse du PoolDose"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Its IP address (or host name) on your network, as shown by your router. Give it a fixed address (DHCP reservation).",
        "fr": "Son adresse IP (ou son nom d’hôte) sur votre réseau, telle que l’affiche votre box. Donnez-lui une adresse fixe (réservation DHCP)."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "192.168.1.50",
        "fr": "192.168.1.50"
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "port",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Port (optional)",
        "fr": "Port (facultatif)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "0 for the standard port (80, or 443 with HTTPS).",
        "fr": "0 pour le port standard (80, ou 443 en HTTPS)."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 65535
    },
    {
      "key": "use_ssl",
      "type": "boolean",
      "label": {
        "en": "HTTPS",
        "fr": "HTTPS"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Only if your device answers in HTTPS. Off by default (the PoolDose answers in HTTP).",
        "fr": "Seulement si votre appareil répond en HTTPS. Désactivé par défaut (le PoolDose répond en HTTP)."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "ssl_verify",
      "type": "boolean",
      "label": {
        "en": "Check the HTTPS certificate",
        "fr": "Vérifier le certificat HTTPS"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "With HTTPS only. Turn it off for a self-signed certificate of the device.",
        "fr": "En HTTPS seulement. Désactivez-le pour un certificat auto-signé de l’appareil."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "poll_interval",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh interval (s)",
        "fr": "Intervalle de rafraîchissement (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Seconds between two reads of the device (30 to 900).",
        "fr": "Secondes entre deux lectures de l’appareil (30 à 900)."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 60,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 900
    },
    {
      "key": "language",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Language of the names",
        "fr": "Langue des noms"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Used for the feature names of the device added from now on, the dosing modes and the alarm names of the scene triggers.",
        "fr": "Sert aux noms des fonctionnalités de l’appareil ajouté désormais, aux modes de dosage et aux noms d’alarme des déclencheurs de scène."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "fr",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "fr",
          "label": {
            "en": "French",
            "fr": "Français"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "en",
          "label": {
            "en": "English",
            "fr": "Anglais"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "test_connection",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the connection",
        "fr": "Tester la connexion"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Reads the device once (model, firmware, values). Also retries at once after a refusal.",
        "fr": "Lit une fois l’appareil (modèle, micrologiciel, valeurs). Réessaie aussi aussitôt après un refus."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30
    }
  ],
